RiffleUpperV2.FirstMoment.costClass_tilt_log.{u_1} {J : Type u_1} [Fintype J] [DecidableEq J] {k N : ℕ} (hN : 2 ≤ N)
  (p : J → TimeProfile.Simplex k) (I : Finset J) (chi width theta : ℝ) (htheta : 1 ≤ theta) (w0 w : J → Fin k)
  (hw : w ∈ RiffleUpperV2.FirstMoment.costClass N p I chi width w0) :
  Real.log
      (∏ j : J,
        RiffleUpperV2.FirstMoment.classTilt p (RiffleUpperV2.FirstMoment.goodPositions p I chi w0) theta w0 j (w j)) =
    -theta * RiffleUpperV2.FirstMoment.goodCost N p I chi w * TimeProfile.logScale N +
      ∑ j ∈ RiffleUpperV2.FirstMoment.goodPositions p I chi w0, TimeProfile.psi (p j) theta
'RiffleUpperV2.FirstMoment.costClass_tilt_log' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
RiffleUpperV2.FirstMoment.classEntropy_goodPositions.{u_1} {J : Type u_1} [Fintype J] [DecidableEq J] {k N : ℕ}
